/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{arcsec}\\,x.\n$$\n\nTherefore,  we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (5\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{4}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}})\\text{d}x & =\\int 5\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+\\int \\frac{4}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+4\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)+4\\text{ arcsec }x+C \\\\  & =-5\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+4\\text{ arcsec }x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-71774/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "67f41769-a0ff-5ecc-8b05-5890a7ac9fe3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-71774"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114181/selection/a6888dbfbb43eb29ccf1a55fe30fb9b2f309c3af8239c7e46540d867c503f33f" :answer/id #uuid "3d1707e1-702d-5ec8-9e62-06ae6504b3a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5x+\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114181/selection/dee890eb43721041c1d77051346152484ba4900cdfe5f382119a54072e8b93f6" :answer/id #uuid "603da356-3871-547a-9b0d-c92674d2d4f9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+5\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114181/selection/9f83f372a53f2389861432dfb553ddbf6d88927c694eaadc261c422d249a94ce" :answer/id #uuid "996c440a-d3cb-5f97-9544-aef55a5feb3d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3x+2\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114181/selection/fab3edfb3a120eecbb297c1585a17e5e96bcca069bfb39ce160b4df2fa0134db" :answer/id #uuid "829f9960-22a7-50b0-ab67-fef75b423cab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x+3\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114181/selection/ed90c12f429a877889429ba88ed33bb43635f5fac3ee536cd60b359cea410d10" :answer/id #uuid "8a8b7d34-4b6c-5b3c-90fb-523f0fb9451e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5x-\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114181/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f63462ba-a3bb-5717-88b3-985b7147563b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114181/selection/dee890eb43721041c1d77051346152484ba4900cdfe5f382119a54072e8b93f6" :answer-field/choices ["q-114181/selection/a6888dbfbb43eb29ccf1a55fe30fb9b2f309c3af8239c7e46540d867c503f33f" "q-114181/selection/dee890eb43721041c1d77051346152484ba4900cdfe5f382119a54072e8b93f6" "q-114181/selection/9f83f372a53f2389861432dfb553ddbf6d88927c694eaadc261c422d249a94ce" "q-114181/selection/fab3edfb3a120eecbb297c1585a17e5e96bcca069bfb39ce160b4df2fa0134db" "q-114181/selection/ed90c12f429a877889429ba88ed33bb43635f5fac3ee536cd60b359cea410d10"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114181" :question/id #uuid "e3e53fc5-fb4f-5b9a-bea6-773144fce85f" :question/math-academy-id "q-114181" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{{x}^{2}+6}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "This integral doesn't look like one of the basic ones. However, we can manipulate the numerator a bit  to make it look more like the denominator, which reveals a more familiar expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}+6}{{x}^{2}+1} & =\\frac{{x}^{2}+1-1+6}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{({x}^{2}+1)+5}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{{x}^{2}+1}}{\\cancel{{x}^{2}+1}}+\\frac{5}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =1+\\frac{5}{{x}^{2}+1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRemembering that\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x,\n$$\n\nwe can now calculate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{x}^{2}+6}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (1+\\frac{5}{{x}^{2}+1})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\text{d}x+\\int \\frac{5}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\text{d}x+5\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x+5\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-114181/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8e6b5d85-0b53-580f-9520-6c33463231d5"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114181"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114183/selection/dee890eb43721041c1d77051346152484ba4900cdfe5f382119a54072e8b93f6" :answer/id #uuid "0c293d19-bb0e-5e53-a2a3-8e91a379d6d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+5\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114183/selection/b06957a75cf3d74747d1cdcf39c6422c45206fb1216755d65d4a1b7548a171a1" :answer/id #uuid "f0efd694-d83f-5afc-8b59-8aab7b46d02c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5x-5\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114183/selection/9c6a0ff8e4102bb0aa6153553e9a9b7fffe6a03de786b6c12edb203e5b48906b" :answer/id #uuid "3e75102f-c67d-5b6c-9047-8e675df26e9f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5x+5\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114183/selection/ba28b94df42f5092be0e5b581b77e81400eb5d0db03d9d2cf4a2902969f5964c" :answer/id #uuid "a9e952d9-fa67-5aa5-a3a2-6af2498fa246" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x-5\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114183/selection/fab3edfb3a120eecbb297c1585a17e5e96bcca069bfb39ce160b4df2fa0134db" :answer/id #uuid "9c931916-e3ad-52ef-9c42-32f4cefc64bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x+3\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114183/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2605ada3-dbc7-5d8d-a9bf-a3e805176760" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114183/selection/b06957a75cf3d74747d1cdcf39c6422c45206fb1216755d65d4a1b7548a171a1" :answer-field/choices ["q-114183/selection/dee890eb43721041c1d77051346152484ba4900cdfe5f382119a54072e8b93f6" "q-114183/selection/b06957a75cf3d74747d1cdcf39c6422c45206fb1216755d65d4a1b7548a171a1" "q-114183/selection/9c6a0ff8e4102bb0aa6153553e9a9b7fffe6a03de786b6c12edb203e5b48906b" "q-114183/selection/ba28b94df42f5092be0e5b581b77e81400eb5d0db03d9d2cf4a2902969f5964c" "q-114183/selection/fab3edfb3a120eecbb297c1585a17e5e96bcca069bfb39ce160b4df2fa0134db"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114183" :question/id #uuid "a3a452e3-2a1b-56c7-8bb2-c02d5c63e932" :question/math-academy-id "q-114183" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{5{x}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "This integral doesn't look like one of the basic ones. However, we can manipulate the numerator a bit  to make it look more like the denominator, which reveals a more familiar expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5{x}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+1} & =\\frac{5{x}^{2}+5-5}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{5({x}^{2}+1)-5}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{5({x}^{2}+1)}{{x}^{2}+1}-\\frac{5}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\cancel{({x}^{2}+1)}}{\\cancel{{x}^{2}+1}}-\\frac{5}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =5-\\frac{5}{{x}^{2}+1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRemembering that\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x,\n$$\n\nwe can now calculate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{5{x}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (5-\\frac{5}{{x}^{2}+1})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5\\int \\text{d}x-5\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5x-5\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-114183/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8e6b5d85-0b53-580f-9520-6c33463231d5"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114183"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-71779/selection/c06879df6cefea740cb5dd37f0ac2bce667a8f8d0ae828ce4ccace21696b8cab" :answer/id #uuid "4cfee2d8-4cf7-525f-aa6b-7120847a36f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{2}+\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x+C" :db/e